  {
   "id": "seg1-00",
   "text": "2026 年 10 月 29 日，Binance 的热钱包，开始大额转出。",
   "spoken": "2026 年 10 月 29 日，Binance 的热钱包，开始大额转出。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 5.112,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.888
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-01",
   "text": "先是 XRP，再是比特币，然后是以太坊。",
   "spoken": "先是 XRP，再是比特币，然后是以太坊。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.932,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 7.03,
   "speechEnd": 10.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-02",
   "text": "一条链接着一条链，资产往外流。",
   "spoken": "一条链接着一条链，资产往外流。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-02.mp3",
   "start": 11.496,
   "dur": 3.6,
   "speechStart": 11.594,
   "speechEnd": 14.284
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-03",
   "text": "交易所发现之后，暂停了提现。",
   "spoken": "交易所发现之后，暂停了提现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-03.mp3",
   "start": 15.316,
   "dur": 3.288,
   "speechStart": 15.414,
   "speechEnd": 17.771
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-04",
   "text": "可按项目方的初步报告，暂停提现，没有挡住全部的未授权转账。",
   "spoken": "可按项目方的初步报告，暂停提现，没有挡住全部的未授权转账。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-04.mp3",
   "start": 18.824,
   "dur": 6.12,
   "speechStart": 18.922,
   "speechEnd": 24.1
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-05",
   "text": "最后一笔，到世界协调时 23 点 56 分，才转完。",
   "spoken": "最后一笔，到世界协条时 23 点 56 分，才转完。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.164,
   "dur": 5.208,
   "speechStart": 25.262,
   "speechEnd": 29.547
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-06",
   "text": "项目方的口径是，约 63.4 亿美元。",
   "spoken": "项目方的口径是，约 63.4 亿美元。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.592,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 30.69,
   "speechEnd": 33.618
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-07",
   "text": "这是有记录以来，最大的一起加密资产盗窃案。",
   "spoken": "这是有记录以来，最大的一起加密资产盗窃案。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-07.mp3",
   "start": 34.676,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 34.774,
   "speechEnd": 38.107
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-08",
   "text": "更反常的是，Binance 称，没有发现私钥泄露的证据。",
   "spoken": "更反常的是，Binance 称，没有发现私钥泄漏的证据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-08.mp3",
   "start": 39.168,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 39.266,
   "speechEnd": 43.063
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-09",
   "text": "没有私钥，钱是怎么签出去的？",
   "spoken": "没有私钥，钱是怎么签出去的？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-09.mp3",
   "start": 44.116,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 44.214,
   "speechEnd": 46.392
  },
  {
   "id": "seg1-10",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep23/audio/lines/seg1-10.mp3",
